00:22:53.790 --> 00:22:56.770
It's krill that makes the biggest whales even possible.

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:10.400
Chin-strap penguins eat almost nothing but krill, and there are about 15 million of them.

00:23:11.400 --> 00:23:16.240
